docs {
  # Admin - Get WebSocket Stats

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/ws/stats`
  **Auth:** Required (Admin Access Token — `ADMIN` role)

  ## Description
  Returns lightweight, lock-free operational counters and health summary for the current backend instance's WebSocket hub.

  > **Multi-instance note:** Behind a Load Balancer, `instance_id` identifies which backend pod served the request.

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Admin Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "instance_id": "api-pod-1-a1b2c3d4",
      "status": "running",
      "started_at": "2026-11-26T10:00:00Z",
      "uptime_seconds": 1825,
      "active_connections": 42,
      "anonymous_connections": 0,
      "unique_users": 35,
      "active_channels": 12,
      "total_accepted": 128,
      "total_closed": 86,
      "total_rejected_limit": 1,
      "total_rejected_auth": 4,
      "messages_enqueued": 1024,
      "messages_sent": 1020,
      "messages_dropped": 0,
      "messages_received": 310,
      "inbound_errors": 2,
      "heartbeat_failures": 3
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Response Field Reference
  | Field | Type | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `instance_id` | `string` | Hostname + short instance ID of the responding pod |
  | `status` | `string` | `"running"` or `"closed"` |
  | `started_at` | `RFC3339` | UTC startup time of the hub |
  | `uptime_seconds` | `int64` | Seconds elapsed since `started_at` |
  | `active_connections` | `int` | Currently open WebSocket connections on this instance |
  | `anonymous_connections` | `int` | Open unauthenticated connections (`user_id == 0`) |
  | `unique_users` | `int` | Distinct authenticated users currently connected on this instance |
  | `active_channels` | `int` | Generic channels/rooms with at least 1 subscriber |
  | `total_accepted` | `uint64` | Cumulative connections registered since startup |
  | `total_closed` | `uint64` | Cumulative connections unregistered since startup |
  | `total_rejected_limit` | `uint64` | Handshakes rejected due to `WS_MAX_CONNS_PER_USER` |
  | `total_rejected_auth` | `uint64` | Handshakes rejected due to authentication failure |
  | `messages_enqueued` | `uint64` | Outbound envelopes placed into client send buffers |
  | `messages_sent` | `uint64` | Outbound envelopes successfully written to sockets |
  | `messages_dropped` | `uint64` | Envelopes dropped because client send buffer was full |
  | `messages_received` | `uint64` | Valid JSON envelopes read from clients |
  | `inbound_errors` | `uint64` | Malformed frames, invalid envelopes, or inbound handler errors |
  | `heartbeat_failures` | `uint64` | Connections closed after `Conn.Ping` timeout or error |

  ## Errors
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing, expired, invalid, or revoked token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Insufficient permissions (requires `ADMIN` role)
}
